  }

  note right of asset_photos
    Direct asset photos are projected from
    `application_documents` where
    `owner_type='ASSET_LEDGER'`
    and `document_category='PHOTO'`
    and `deleted_at IS NULL`.
    Data matching confirm copies survey photo
    metadata from
    `owner_type='ASSET_SURVEY_RECORD'`
    records to `ASSET_LEDGER` records for
    created `asset_ledgers`.
    S3 object key in `file_path` and
    `content_hash` are reused;
    the binary object is not duplicated.
    `survey_record_id` keeps source provenance.
    Inherited asset photos have exactly one
